log_2(f(n)+1)\\rceil\\le ag(n)\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{TIME}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TIME}(g)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.3}\\vdash\nf,g\\in\\mathrm{TimeConstr}\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;\nbf(n)\\lceil\\log_2(f(n)+1)\\rceil\\le ag(n)\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{TIME}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TIME}(g)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应 1979 年原书的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"dfb238ddf618b68f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\mathrm{TimeConstr},\\mathrm{TIME}$ 见 [[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]，两者均使用同一资源机上下文。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TimeConstr},\\mathrm{TIME}","display":false},{"tex":"o","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.3}\\vdash\nf,g\\in\\mathrm{TimeConstr}\